\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Preference-region-aware transfer and offspring feedback. The primary parent's task and upcoming preference select the utility context; a budgeted gate chooses local or cross-task mating. Feedback follows the child's inherited task and uses real evaluated outcomes. The five displayed preference cells are numbered $1$--$5$ for presentation and correspond to indices $k=0,\ldots  ,4$ in the equations.}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:adaptive-transfer}{{3}{7}{Preference-region-aware transfer and offspring feedback. The primary parent's task and upcoming preference select the utility context; a budgeted gate chooses local or cross-task mating. Feedback follows the child's inherited task and uses real evaluated outcomes. The five displayed preference cells are numbered $1$--$5$ for presentation and correspond to indices $k=0,\ldots ,4$ in the equations}{figure.3}{}}
